<title>DENMARK: Danish Novo Nordisk 9-mo profits up.</title>
<headline>Danish Novo Nordisk 9-mo profits up.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result    1.893 billion vs  1.656 billion</p>
<p> Group net result	  1.344 billion vs  1.209 billion</p>
<p> Group net turnover     10.725 billion vs  10.275 billion</p>
<p> Result per share (crowns)	35.83  vs  32.23</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish pharmaceuticals and biotechnology group is Novo Nordisk A/S. It said in a statement that it maintained its previous forecast of 10-15 percent higher whole year 1996 operating and pre-tax profits. The result was above analyst expectations of an average 1.852 billion crown pre-tax profit for the period.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
